Package: bazaar-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, systemd
Description: Bazaar company server host
 Bazaar.Server.Host runs the Bazaar company server as a systemd service.
 The package bundles a self-contained .NET build, so no .NET runtime is
 needed on the host. PostgreSQL 18 with pgvector is not installed by this
 package; the operator provides it and points the server at it.
 .
 The service is enabled but not started on install. Set up the config and
 the database credential, run the migrate command, then start the service.
 The status listener binds to loopback only.
